<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">shogun</ansi>

The Shogun is the neutral elite of the Hatamoto. A commander: the whole
company starts a battle sooner, its Bodyguard stands in more often, and its
row fights under a banner.

<ansi fg="yellow-bold">Ranks</ansi>

  30 Commander's presence  every ally's action meter starts a battle 15
                           points higher
  35 Sworn guard           Bodyguard: 4 times a battle
  40 Bannerline            allies in its row take 8% less damage
  45 Lacquered armor       +4 armor
  50 Rallying standard     allies in its row gain +6 Evasion
  55 Hardened command      +10% maximum health and +3 Attack
  60 Banner of war         allies in its row gain +5 Attack while it stands

It needs the Hatamoto first (<ansi fg="command">help samurai-routes</ansi>) and keeps every rank of it. At level 30 a
character that holds it promotes with <ansi fg="command">class promote [member] shogun confirm</ansi>. Any alignment may take it.
Everything here lasts only for the battle and is never saved.

<ansi fg="yellow-bold">Elite talents</ansi>

Elite Samurai talents (levels 35, 45, 55): Razor's Edge (+5% critical chance
on every blow), Quick Hands (starts a battle with 15 points on its action
meter), Shadow Footing (+5 Evasion). See <ansi fg="command">help talents</ansi>.

See also: <ansi fg="command">help samurai-routes</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help elite</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help promotion</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help talents</ansi>.
